This code uses the `pigpio` library to read the pressure data from the Melexis MLX90824 SENT pressure sensor on GPIO4 (BCM) of the Raspberry Pi 3 Model B+. It reads the pressure data in the format of a single-wire protocol, and extracts the status nibble, three data nibbles, and the checksum nibble. The code also checks for sensor absent condition and bus errors, and logs the pressure data to a file named `pressure_log.txt` in the format "YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS, Pressure: XXXX.XX Pa". The code handles errors and releases resources on all exit paths.

