This code initializes the GPIO and PWM libraries, sets up the GPIO pins for the sensors and motors, and defines the control law for the robot. It then enters a loop that reads the sensor values every 10 milliseconds and updates the motor speeds accordingly. The code also logs the sensor values and motor speeds to a file named `trace_log.txt` every 10 milliseconds.

The code also includes robust error handling for initializing the driver library, opening the log file, and all GPIO operations, and installs a SIGINT handler that on receipt stops both motors, closes the log file, terminates the driver library and ensures that all driver library API calls are properly released before exiting.

